[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0010","text":"──哎呀。呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0020","text":"小咲耶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0030","text":"结华，有应援消息发过来了哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0040","text":"哦\n啊哈哈真的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0050","text":"雾子发了照片过来\n……好可爱啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0060","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0080","text":"这张照片里，一定也凝聚着雾子“加油”的心意吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0090","text":"是呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0100","text":"那么两位，准备工作已经完成了……\n请多关照。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0110","text":"好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0120","text":"『装点四季的L'Antica』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0130","text":"『勾勒明眸的深邃眼线』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0140","text":"『水润唇彩\n　以光泽双唇编织的魔法』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0150","text":"『将璀璨与心动轻抚于肌肤\n　令人目眩的时光，此刻开启──』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0160","text":"辛苦了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0170","text":"哎呀，和拍摄前的气氛，\n简直判若两人啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0180","text":"刚才还那么其乐融融的，\n真是吓了一跳！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0190","text":"啊哈，谢谢夸奖！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0200","text":"我们可是酷炫系组合嘛。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_02020000_05_0013","text":"Motion"}]
